Welcome to riconvert, a Records in Contexts Ontology (RiC-O) conversion utility.
It detects a *.drawio and *.csv file in the same folder (only one of each must exist).
It uses the DrawIO file to create a Manchester OWL, Turtle, and RML (RDF Mapping language) file.
It uses the RML file to map the CSV file into triples (Turtle or N3).
